nous voice with limite…","title":"Stability"},"style":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number"},{"type":"null"}],"default":0.0,"description":"Determines the style exaggeration of the voice. This setting attempts to amplify the style of the original speaker. It does consume additional computational resources and might increase latency if se…","title":"Style"},"use_speaker_boost":{"anyOf":[{"type":"boolean"},{"type":"null"}],"default":true,"description":"This setting boosts the similarity to the original speaker. Using this setting requires a slightly higher computational load, which in turn increases latency.","title":"Use Speaker Boost"}},"title":"VoiceSettingsResponseModel","type":"object"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Voice settings overriding stored settings for the given voice. They are applied only on the given request."}},"required":["text"],"title":"Body_text_to_speech_stream","type":"object"}},"deprecated":false,"details":"Converts text into speech using a voice of your choice and returns audio as an audio stream.","group":"Text to speech","id":"text_to_speech_stream","method":"POST","parameters":[{"description":"Voice ID to be used, you can use https://api.elevenlabs.io/v1/voices to list all the available voices.","location":"path","name":"voice_id","required":true,"schema":{"description":"Voice ID to be used, you can use https://api.elevenlabs.io/v1/voices to list all the available voices.","examples":["21m00Tcm4TlvDq8ikWAM"],"title":"Voice Id","type":"string"}},{"defaultValue":true,"description":"When enable_logging is set to false zero retention mode will be used for the request. This will mean history features are unavailable for this request, including request stitching. Zero retention mode may only be used by enterprise customers.","location":"query","name":"enable_logging","required":false,"schema":{"default":true,"description":"When enable_logging is set to false zero retention mode will be used for the request. This will mean history features are unavailable 