hether to store the generated song for inpainting.","title":"Store For Inpainting","type":"boolean"},"use_phonetic_names":{"default":false,"description":"If true, proper names in the prompt will be phonetically spelled in the lyrics for better pronunciation by the music model. The original names will be restored in word timestamps.","title":"Use Phonetic Names","type":"boolean"}},"title":"Body_Stream_composed_music_v1_music_stream_post","type":"object"}},"deprecated":false,"details":"Stream a composed song from a prompt or a composition plan.","group":"Music","id":"stream_compose","method":"POST","parameters":[{"defaultValue":"auto","description":"Output format of the generated audio. Formatted as codec_sample_rate_bitrate. Use \"auto\" (the default) to let the API pick the best format for the selected model: mp3_44100_128 for v1 models and mp3_48000_192 for v2 models.","location":"query","name":"output_format","required":false,"schema":{"default":"auto","enum":["auto","mp3_48000_128","mp3_48000_192","mp3_48000_240","mp3_48000_320","mp3_22050_32","mp3_24000_48","mp3_44100_32","mp3_44100_64","mp3_44100_96","mp3_44100_128","mp3_44100_192","pcm_8000","pcm_16000","pcm_22050","pcm_24000","pcm_32000","pcm_44100","pcm_48000","ulaw_8000","alaw_8000","opus_48000_32","opus_48000_64","opus_48000_96","opus_48000_128","opus_48000_192"],"title":"Output format of the generated audio.","type":"string"}}],"path":"/v1/music/stream","response":{"kind":"audio"},"summary":"Stream Composed Music","supportsStreaming":true},
{"body":{"contentType":"multipart","fileFields":["file"],"required":true,"schema":{"properties":{"extract_composition_plan":{"anyOf":[{"type":"boolean"},{"default":"music_v1","enum":["music_v1","music_v2","music_v2_5"],"title":"MusicModelID","type":"string"}],"default":false,"description":"Whether to generate and return the composition plan for the uploaded song. Pass a model id (`music_v1`, `music_v2` or `music_v2_5`) to control which composition plan format is returned. Passing `true`/`false` is deprecated; `true` defaults to the `music_v1` plan format. Enabling this will increase the latency.","title":"Extract Composition Plan"},"file":{"description":"The audio file to upload.","format":"binary","title":"File","type":"string"},"with_timestamps":{"default":false,"description":"Whether to transcribe the uploaded song and return word-level timestamps. If True, the response will include words_timestamps but will increase the latency.","title":"With Timestamps","type":"boolean"},"with_waveform_visual":{"default":false,"description":"Whether to return the visual waveform of the uploaded song.","title":"With Waveform Visual","type":"boolean"}},"required":["file"],"title":"Body_Upload_music_v1_music_upload_post","type":"object"}},"deprecated":false,"details":"Upload a music file to be later used for inpainting. Price for uploading is the same as the one for song generation. All uploaded content gets inspected for copyright infringement. If copyrighted content is detected, half of the request cost is still charged.","group":"Music","id":"upload_song","method":"POST","parameters":[],"path":"/v1/music/upload","response":{"kind":"json"},"summary":"Upload Music","supportsStreaming":false},
