{"body":{"contentType":"json","fileFields":[],"required":true,"schema":{"properties":{"target_language":{"description":"BCP-47 language tag to dub the project into (for example, `fr` or `es-MX`). Must be one of the [languages the project's dubbing model supports](https://elevenlabs.io/docs/help-center/product/dubbing/which-languages-are-supported-in-dubbing), and a region-qualified tag must be one of the supported dialects.","title":"Target Language","type":"string"},"translations":{"anyOf":[{"additionalProperties":{"type":"string"},"type":"object"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Enterprise only. Optional translations to use instead of machine translation. A map from each source segment's `external_id` (or its `id`, if you supplied none) to the translated text; every source segment must be covered exactly once. At most 20,000 entries, totaling at most 4 MiB of text. See [Bring your own transcript](https://elevenlabs.io/docs/eleven-api/guides/how-to/dubbing/bring-your-own-…","title":"Translations"},"voice_settings":{"anyOf":[{"properties":{"cloning_strength":{"default":7,"description":"How strongly the dubbed speakers clone the source voices, 0 to 10.","maximum":10.0,"minimum":0.0,"title":"Cloning Strength","type":"integer"}},"title":"VoiceSettings","type":"object"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Voice settings applied to every speaker in this language. Omit to use the defaults."}},"required":["target_language"],"title":"Body_Create_Dubbing_Language_Target_v1_dubbing_project__project_id__language_post","type":"object"}},"deprecated":false,"details":"Add a language to dub a project into, and queue the dub.\n\nThis is the call that produces dubbed audio, and it is billed per generation. The target is created `queued` and starts as soon as the project is `ready`, so it can be added at any point after the project is created. It inherits the project's dubbing model and cannot pick another.\n\nA project created with `webhook_ids` sends a `dubbing_language_completed` event carrying the output download URLs, so we recommend subscribing rather than polling this target to completion.","group":"Dubbing projects","id":"dubbing_language_create","method":"POST","parameters":[{"description":"Identifier of the parent dubbing project.","location":"path","name":"project_id","required":true,"schema":{"description":"Identifier of the parent dubbing project.","title":"Project Id","type":"string"}}],"path":"/v1/dubbing/project/{project_id}/language","response":{"kind":"json"},"summary":"Create Dubbing Language Target","supportsStreaming":false},
